# Deployment-local ops values — the map, as opposed to the method. The tracked
# runbook (docs/runbooks/jetson-deploy.md) ships the genericized method and a
# stub pointing here; the host name, login user, tree/backup paths, keychain
# item + sudo retrieval line and monitoring internals are per-deployment and
# never committed.
